X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_316218675@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260913T043025Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T171500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T201500
SUMMARY:Arbor Evenings - NC Arboretum 🌿🎶
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n## Arbor Evenings at the NC Arboretum 🌿
 🎶\n\nCome spend an evening with AVL Digital Nomads at the **North Carol
 ina Arboretum for Arbor Evenings**. We’ll wander the gardens\, grab a dr
 ink\, listen to live music\, and enjoy golden hour with fellow Nomads.\n**
 Arbor Evenings is free to attend**\, and we have **10 complimentary parkin
 g passes** for our group. Since parking is normally $20 per vehicle\, we
 ’re going to carpool and make those passes go as far as possible.\n\n###
  IMPORTANT: Where We’re Meeting\n\n**Do not go directly to the Arboretum
  if you plan to use one of our complimentary passes.**\nWe’ll meet at:\n
 **the "At Home" store parking lot**\n980 Brevard Rd\nAsheville\, NC 28806\
 nMeet **behind Chick-fil-A** and look for cars with **AVL Digital Nomads s
 igns on top**. We’ll organize carpools there and head to the Arboretum t
 ogether.\n\n### Have an Arboretum Membership?\n\nEven better. **If you alr
 eady have an Arboretum membership/pass and are willing to drive and carpoo
 l other Nomads\, please let us know in the Meetup comments.** Your vehicle
  can enter free\, which allows us to save our complimentary passes for oth
 er members.\n\n### A Few Things to Know\n\n* Arbor Evenings itself is **fr
 ee**\n* AVLDN has **10 complimentary parking passes**\n* We’ll distribut
 e those through our carpools\n* After our complimentary passes are claimed
 \, parking is **$20 per vehicle**\n* Arboretum members who receive free en
 try/parking are encouraged to drive and help us carpool\n* Food and bevera
 ges are available for purchase at the event\n\nLet's get away from the scr
 een\, discover a gem of Asheville\, meet some people you might not otherwi
 se cross paths with\, and enjoy a beautiful evening outside.\nRemote work 
 gives us freedom. **Community still requires showing up.**\nCome hang out 
 with us. 🌿\n**More about Arbor Evenings:**\n[NC Arboretum Arbor Evening
 s](https://ncarboretum.org/arborevenings/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/316218675/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260821T213524Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260821T213524Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
