BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Highlandbrewing": "https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/play-through-the-mountains/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:highlandbrewing
X-SOURCE:Highland Brewing
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260917
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260921
DTSTAMP:20260902T202114Z
CREATED:20260716T140838Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T202114Z
UID:10029504-1789603200-1789948799@highlandbrewing.com
SUMMARY:PGA Week: Play Through The Mountains at Highland
DESCRIPTION:Asheville is teeing up for a historic week as the PGA TOUR returns to Western North Carolina for the first time since 1942 at the Jack Nicklaus-designed Cliffs at Walnut Cove. Throughout tournament weekend\, swing by Highland Brewing as part of Play Through the Mountains\, a countywide initiative celebrating the neighborhoods\, small businesses\, and local experiences that make Buncombe County special. \n\n\nAt Highland Brewing\, we’re bringing the golf spirit to the Meadow and Taproom with:\nBar specials: \n\n$6 20oz Pilsners\nArnold Palmers & Transfusions\n\n\nThe Biltmore Championship Asheville tournament broadcast in the Taproom\nDiscounted brewery tours throughout tournament weekend for visitors looking to experience Asheville’s first brewery (use code GOLF to book)\n\nThursday\, September 17: Mini Golf in the Meadow \nWhether you’re following the tournament action or exploring Asheville between rounds\, make Highland a stop on your Play Through the Mountains adventure. Cheers to golf\, great beer\, and supporting local. 🍻⛳️
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/play-through-the-mountains/
LOCATION:Taproom At Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Public Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/OBrien_DJI_221017_0069-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
