UID:b09ed88e093a910056c283d7c6386d5a@ashevillechamber.org
DESCRIPTION:Resources for Resilience™ is an Asheville-based nonprofit of
 fering educational workshops and trainings for individuals\, teams and com
 munities to navigate trauma\, manage stress\, and prevent burnout. Our fac
 ilitators are holding space for the myriad of emotions WNC residents may b
 e experiencing at this two-year mark since Helene. As such\, we are offeri
 ng the following opportunities for learning of practical tools to process 
 the journey of recovery and rebuilding\, held at two different locations t
 h
