DESCRIPTION:Join us Friday\, September 25 from 7:00–8:30 p.m. at the Wea
 verville Community Center for Borderlands\, a thought-provoking evening pr
 esented by In Other Words.Directed by Deborah Kinsey and Deb Martin\, the 
 program explores the complicated issues\, emotions\, and realities that em
 erge when arbitrary lines are drawn.Through poetry\, essays\, stories\, an
 d music\, Borderlands invites us to consider the meaning of borders and th
 e human experiences connected to them. This program is intended for mature
  audi
