DESCRIPTION:Join usfor an evening of storytelling and conversation with Ra
 y Christian\, a Black veteran from the rural South whose life has taken hi
 m through academia\, public speaking\, podcasting\, parenting\, and quite 
 literally tending goats in his backyard.Ray brings a unique perspective an
 d a gift for weaving together the experiences\, observations\, and stories
  that shape a life. Come listen\, connect\, and enjoy an evening of storie
 s that invite us to see life from a different perspective.
