BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Calendar Ics": "https://events.warren-wilson.edu/event/nielsen-big-idea-lecture-what-does-homophobia-have-to-do-with-racism"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_calendar_ics
X-SOURCE:Warren Wilson College
DTSTAMP:20260913T043059Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53876340063645
DTSTART:20261022T230000Z
DTEND:20261023T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Warren Wilson College for a Nielsen Big Idea Lecture featu
 ring Ladelle McWhorter\, Chair of Gender & Sexuality Studies at the Univer
 sity of Richmond.\n \n\nIn her talk\, “What Does Homophobia Have to Do W
 ith Racism? Let’s Look at the History\,” McWhorter will explore the hi
 storical connections between homophobia\, racism\, and systems of oppressi
 on. Drawing from her scholarship and decades of work in social justice\, s
 he will examine how these histories intersect and continue to shape our co
 mmunities today.\n \n\nMcWhorter is the author of Bodies and Pleasures\, R
 acism and Sexual Oppression in Anglo-America and Unbecoming Persons. She h
 as worked for social justice for more than thirty years with Virginia Orga
 nizing\, a grassroots organization dedicated to dismantling racism\, fight
 ing poverty and environmental injustice\, and training ordinary Virginians
  to advocate for themselves and their communities.
GEO:35.610912;-82.442142
LOCATION:Canon Lounge in Gladfelter Student Center
SUMMARY:Nielsen Big Idea Lecture: What Does Homophobia Have to Do With Raci
 sm?
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.warren-wilson.edu/event/nielsen-big-idea-lectu
 re-what-does-homophobia-have-to-do-with-racism
CATEGORIES:Lecture
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Calendar Ics": "https://events.warren-wilson.edu/event/nielsen-lecture-ladelle-mcwhorter-what-does-homophobia-have-to-do-with-racism-lets-look-at-the-history"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_calendar_ics
X-SOURCE:Warren Wilson College
DTSTAMP:20260913T043059Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52530516845261
DTSTART:20261022T230000Z
DTEND:20261023T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:Ladelle McWhorter\, a long time academic and activist\, will di
 scuss the historical intersections of homophobia and racism\, finding thei
 r deep roots in stereotypes and marginalization.\n\n \n\nVisitors from off
  campus should park in the Admissions parking lot located just beyond Orr 
 Cottage\, located at 114 Lower College Rd\, Swannanoa\, NC. For google map
 s directions\, you can use this dropped pin: https://maps.app.goo.gl/4EqWw
 mK51EtHn5uq8
GEO:35.610912;-82.442142
LOCATION:Canon Lounge in Gladfelter Student Center\, Canon Lounge
SUMMARY:Nielsen Lecture:  Ladelle McWhorter\, "What Does Homophobia Have To
  Do With Racism?"  Let's look at the history
