 llot in person on select days prior to Election Day. Voters can choose to 
 vote at any early voting site. Early voting begins on October 15 and ends 
 on the last Saturday before the election\, Oct. 31 at 3 p.m. https://www.b
 uncombenc.gov/calendar.aspx?EID=10763
